[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057103010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108165#issuecomment-3057103010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108165","id":3057103010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62N7Ci","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T11:44:08Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T11:44:08Z","body":"There are two issues with this camera application:\r\n- The `CameraLinux::_update_devices` function automatically updates the `CameraFeed` list, causing unnecessary background processing.\r\n- When `CameraLinux::set_monitoring_feeds` is called with `true`, `false`, `true` in sequence, the `CameraFeed` list is not updated from the second call onwards.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@onready var reload = $ReloadButton\r\nvar current_feed: CameraFeed\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\treload.pressed.connect(_on_pressed_reload)\r\n\r\nfunc _on_pressed_reload():\r\n\tif CameraServer.monitoring_feeds:\r\n\t\tCameraServer.monitoring_feeds = false\r\n\t\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\tif not CameraServer.feeds_updated.is_connected(_on_feeds_updated):\r\n\t\tCameraServer.feeds_updated.connect(_on_feeds_updated)\r\n\tCameraServer.monitoring_feeds = true\r\n\r\nfunc _on_feeds_updated():\r\n\tvar feeds = CameraServer.feeds()\r\n\tif not feeds.is_empty():\r\n\t\tvar current_feed = feeds[0]\r\n\t\tcurrent_feed.frame_changed.connect(_on_frame_changed, ConnectFlag.CONNECT_DEFERRED | ConnectFlag.CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\r\n\r\nfunc _on_frame_changed():\r\n\t// processing camera images\r\n\tpass\r\n```\r\n\r\nTherefore, we want to update the `CameraFeed` list only when `CameraLinux::set_monitoring_feeds` is set to `true`, and clear the `CameraFeed` list when set to `false`. Is this approach acceptable?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057103010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057148751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108165#issuecomment-3057148751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108165","id":3057148751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62OGNP","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T11:59:19Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T11:59:19Z","body":"> * The `CameraLinux::_update_devices` function automatically updates the `CameraFeed` list, causing unnecessary background processing.\r\n\r\nThis was already the case before the PR. I think it's out of scope to fix this (unless there's an easy solution).\r\n\r\n> * When `CameraLinux::set_monitoring_feeds` is called with `true`, `false`, `true` in sequence, the `CameraFeed` list is not updated from the second call onwards.\r\n\r\nThis is bad, that should definitely be fixed.\r\n\r\n> Therefore, we want to update the `CameraFeed` list only when `CameraLinux::set_monitoring_feeds` is set to `true`, and clear the `CameraFeed` list when set to `false`. Is this approach acceptable?\r\n\r\nThat would remove the Linux platform's ability to auto-update camera feeds altogether. I don't think this is an acceptable regression. The above bug with the `true`, `false`, `true` sequence should be fixed with the current background-updated implementation.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057148751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057188177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108165#issuecomment-3057188177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108165","id":3057188177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62OP1R","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T12:11:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T12:11:55Z","body":"Understood. This PR will not address the `true`, `false`, `true` sequence issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057188177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057204050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108165#issuecomment-3057204050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108165","id":3057204050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62OTtS","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T12:15:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T12:16:03Z","body":"> Understood. This PR will not address the `true`, `false`, `true` sequence issue.\r\n\r\nIf the issue exists on current master, this PR does not _have to_ address it (though it would be good to). If you don't intend to, could you open an issue for it?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057204050/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067538594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108165#issuecomment-3067538594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108165","id":3067538594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc621uyi","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"h